~ falls left, rises right#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
~ both ends rise#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
= rises left, falls right#Correct. Odd degree with negative leading coefficient rises left and falls right.
~ both ends fall#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
}

::ALG2_U02_UA_Q04::
