~ x = -5#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
~ x = 5#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
~ x = -2#This choice does not match the requested Unit 2 feature, solution set, graph behavior, or context interpretation. Recheck the equation, graph feature, and notation.
= x = 2#Correct. The repeated factor is (x - 2)<sup>2</sup>.
}

